{"parse": {"title": "TTS-05", "pageid": 141710, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/TTS-04\" title=\"TTS-04\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">TTS-05</span><a href=\"/wiki/TTS-06\" title=\"TTS-06\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">TTS</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">05</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.BB.BA.E7.AD.91.E7.9A.84.E6.AF.8D.E8.AF.AD\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"建筑的母语\">建筑的母语</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 建筑的母语</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">A Building's Message</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>哦<span class=\"color-value\"></span>建<span class=\"color-value\"></span>筑<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>你<span class=\"color-value\"></span>使<span class=\"color-value\"></span>人<span class=\"color-value\"></span>们<span class=\"color-value\"></span>栖<span class=\"color-value\"></span>居<span class=\"color-value\"></span>在<span class=\"color-value\"></span>你<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>腹<span class=\"color-value\"></span>中<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>倾<span class=\"color-value\"></span>听<span class=\"color-value\"></span>那<span class=\"color-value\"></span>一<span class=\"color-value\"></span>遍<span class=\"color-value\"></span>又<span class=\"color-value\"></span>一<span class=\"color-value\"></span>遍<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>声<span class=\"color-value\"></span>响<span class=\"color-value\"></span>！<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 3810105</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_8_bg_14.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_8_bg_14\"><img alt=\"3_8_bg_14\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/Cg-3_8_bg_14.png/600px-Cg-3_8_bg_14.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/Cg-3_8_bg_14.png/900px-Cg-3_8_bg_14.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/Cg-3_8_bg_14.png/1200px-Cg-3_8_bg_14.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"420203.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-420203.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-420203.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"420203.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-420203.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-420203.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-420203.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-420203.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">魔精：</div><div>——！！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>魔精们惊叫着四散奔逃。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>虚惊一场。这些家伙总能出现在一些意想不到的地方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苍白的男孩：</div><div>它们喜欢这些石头，常在附近扎堆。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苍白的男孩：</div><div>很新奇的神秘术。我还以为你是那种……只会画图的设计师。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>呵呵，如今设计师单靠画图已经远远不够了，得会点神秘术才能在甲方和监工面前拥有话语权。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>我说得对吗，监工女士？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她笑眯眯看向身旁面无表情的同伴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>嗯哼，监工也一样——得会点神秘术才能驳回建筑师异想天开的方案。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>不错，反应很快。说实话，这正是我喜欢和你搭档的原因。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>建筑师一面心不在焉地说着，一面用手指在石料面上轻轻摩挲。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>看样子，穹顶也是由这些回声石建造的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>好了，各位，我的调查暂时告一段落。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她站起身，面向其他几人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>建筑其余部分的结构和材料都没有发现异常之处。需要在意的，只有这处穹顶结构以及建成它的回声石。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>它们很可能是大家能安然躲过“时空灾害”的关键。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚肖：</div><div>但很遗憾，你们来晚了一步。穹顶现在已经彻底损毁了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>我明白了。对于这样的结果，我既不感到意外，也不感到遗憾。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>蓝图行云流水地收起文件，语调轻快。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>接下来我会撰写相关报告，同步基金会，再订上最快的返程机票……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>如果我们能复现这个穹顶呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>……什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>无视同伴震惊的目光，建筑师不紧不慢地走到曾经穹顶的正下方。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_8_at_06.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_8_at_06\"><img alt=\"3_8_at_06\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4a/Cg-3_8_at_06.png/600px-Cg-3_8_at_06.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4a/Cg-3_8_at_06.png/900px-Cg-3_8_at_06.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4a/Cg-3_8_at_06.png/1200px-Cg-3_8_at_06.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她眯起眼，迎着头顶洒落的日光比了一个三角手势。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_8_bg_14.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_8_bg_14\"><img alt=\"3_8_bg_14\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/Cg-3_8_bg_14.png/600px-Cg-3_8_bg_14.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/Cg-3_8_bg_14.png/900px-Cg-3_8_bg_14.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/Cg-3_8_bg_14.png/1200px-Cg-3_8_bg_14.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>这栋建筑的语言很特别。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>在任何空旷、有光，或者能体现出这栋建筑的主要功能之处，我们都能看到一些基本几何形的放大，或组合。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>圆、矩形、三角……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>它们不断重复，组合变换成一些蕴含规律的结构、形态，例如竖向排列的拱顶、中轴线对称的矩形房屋，以及等边三角形的楼板。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>再结合刚才我们对残余的混凝土梁的观察，以及显而易见的穹顶外缘形状……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她停顿片刻，自信地说出了自己的结论。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>这是一个由上层的正圆穹顶与下方的三角体结合而成的结构。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>很精彩的推论，大建筑师，但你逃避了真正的问题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>这和我们此行的唯一任务——调查“不可回溯地”之间，有任何相关性吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>如果我能让它重新变回“不可回溯地”，那不就有关系了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>想想看——我们一同复原图纸，施工验证，最终解开“不可回溯地”的奥秘！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>……我们？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>监工的眼皮不受控制地跳了跳。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>我想我有必要提醒你，这里的“我们”只有三个人。即使算上各自的神秘术，也不可能复现出一个穹顶。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>基金会的施工队几乎都被回溯了，我们也不能在本地直接雇佣工人，这会违反基金会的保密协定。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>……噢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这是尚未来得及考虑的情况，奔逸的思绪被迫刹车——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>当然，只是暂时。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>如果再加上这里的居民呢？他们亲历了“时空灾害”，雇佣他们可不算违反保密协定。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>穹顶面积不大，只要核心的设计问题得到解决，修建并不算难。别忘了，这片土地上的人们当年可是能在十天内造出一整栋筒子楼的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>思路瞬间贯通，话语连绵涌出，建筑师的眼睛也随之亮了起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>更何况，如柏林以东小姐所说，他们都有不同程度的……就业困难。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>比如站在我们眼前的这位先生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚肖：</div><div>……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>你的意思是，我们要在一个很可能缺乏一切必要建材的小城，带着一群毫无经验和纪律可言的人重现神秘的遗迹？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚肖：</div><div>呃……纪律确实没有，但我当初在厂里打过工，我猜这两者之间没什么差别——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚肖：</div><div>你知道的，把猪肉搬来搬去，把砖头搬来搬去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>瞧，就像这样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>盛怒之下，蓝图的语调依旧平稳而克制，这是多年严苛律己留下的本能。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>好了，讨论中止。任何多余的关注和讨论，都是在拖慢进度。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>我们抵达调查区域有一段时间了。按照流程，应该立即向基金会更新任务进展。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>你完全可以将你的“宏伟构想”亲自向基金会陈述——我相信，诸位委员会一致表示认可。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_8_bg_14.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_8_bg_14\"><img alt=\"3_8_bg_14\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/Cg-3_8_bg_14.png/600px-Cg-3_8_bg_14.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/Cg-3_8_bg_14.png/900px-Cg-3_8_bg_14.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/Cg-3_8_bg_14.png/1200px-Cg-3_8_bg_14.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650121.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-650121.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650121.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650121.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-650121.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650121.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-650121.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650121.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">肯纳：</div><div>不错，这次你们坚持了三天零十五个小时，才出现第一次明显分歧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>远在通讯器另一头，听完双方各自的陈述，委员仍旧语带笑意。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>显然，此类“不和”对她而言早已是司空见惯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>严格来说，不到三个小时。我们是今天中午才会合的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650121.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-650121.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650121.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650121.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-650121.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650121.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-650121.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650121.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">肯纳：</div><div>这仍旧超出了我的预期。调查的具体进展，蓝图已经向我做了完整汇报……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她稍作停顿，笑意随之收敛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650120.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-650120.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650120.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650120.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-650120.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650120.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-650120.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650120.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">肯纳：</div><div>显而易见，穹顶已经坍塌。这座建筑未来能否再次从可能发生的“时空灾害”中幸免于难，仍是一个未知数。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650120.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-650120.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650120.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650120.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-650120.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650120.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-650120.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650120.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">肯纳：</div><div>至于穹顶的修建方案……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>琐碎而焦灼的讨论终于结束。建筑师收起通讯器，若有所思地走向同伴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>能讨论这么长的时间，我猜肯纳女士又一次被你说服了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>先解决居民的动员问题，她才有资格去和其他基金会的老爷们谈判——这是肯纳女士的结论。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>至于对谈的细节……你若是感兴趣，回头我会和你认真谈谈。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>建筑师收起往日的戏谑，神情庄重。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>我知道你不喜欢重建的提议，甚至对这项调查工作本身也疑虑颇多。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>在此之前，请容许我先找到居民的话事人聊聊，再谈下一步，如何？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"649012.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-649012.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-649012.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"649012.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-649012.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-649012.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-649012.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-649012.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苍白的男孩：</div><div>呵，你们总是这样自说自话吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>背后的声音突如其来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>不好意思，“你们”是指……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"649013.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/af/HeadIconSmall-649013.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-649013.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"649013.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/af/HeadIconSmall-649013.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-649013.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/af/HeadIconSmall-649013.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-649013.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苍白的男孩：</div><div>你——还有那些从西方来的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>男孩一步一步走到建筑师面前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苍白的男孩：</div><div>你们会拍照、会开会、会在纸上写写画画，自顾自地说着“帮助”“希望”“未来”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苍白的男孩：</div><div>再过几天、几个月……预算花完，报告写完，你们会离开，假装什么都没发生过。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苍白的男孩：</div><div>把我们丢在这里，就像……就像……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>像是触及了一些不愉快的回忆，男孩微微皱眉，不再言语。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>……我理解你们的顾虑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>如你所愿，我们可以明天就离开，只把这当作一次短途考察。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>这样一来，你们什么也得不到。但如果我们解开了穹顶的奥秘再走的话——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>未来如果“时空灾害”卷土重来，这里的人至少能得到第二次机会。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>概率很低，但一定高于零。简单的数学问题，你认为呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>从逻辑上看，这几乎是一个无需争论的事实。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苍白的男孩：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>短暂的沉默后，男孩低下头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苍白的男孩：</div><div>抱歉……我不该说这些话，母亲一定会责怪我……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苍白的男孩：</div><div>不论如何，你们可以随时放弃。这是你们的自由。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>如果我中途随意放弃，那就意味着……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>建筑师俯下身，认真地看着男孩的眼睛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>这从一开始就是一个被允许失败的项目。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>而我的职业道德不允许我接受这样的前提。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>至少在我负责的范围内，它要么被完成，要么被明确宣告无法完成。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苍白的男孩：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苍白的男孩：</div><div>我明白了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>男孩神色和缓了不少，转身离去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>直到抵达另一头的出口，他才停下脚步，看向建筑师。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"649010.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6b/HeadIconSmall-649010.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-649010.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"649010.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6b/HeadIconSmall-649010.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-649010.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6b/HeadIconSmall-649010.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-649010.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苍白的男孩：</div><div>如果你想说服其他居民加入你的工程，我可以带你去我们用餐和聚会的地方，见见我们的话事人奥尔加。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>噢，这再好不过了！请为我们带路，这位——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"649010.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6b/HeadIconSmall-649010.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-649010.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"649010.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6b/HeadIconSmall-649010.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-649010.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6b/HeadIconSmall-649010.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-649010.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卢齐安：</div><div>你可以叫我卢齐安，建筑师女士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>卢齐安……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>模糊的念头一闪而过，却来不及成形。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>建筑师只是点了点头，露出惯常的笑容。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314011.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2b/HeadIconSmall-314011.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314011.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314011.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2b/HeadIconSmall-314011.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314011.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2b/HeadIconSmall-314011.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314011.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>请稍等片刻——等我们先把柏林以东小姐从监听室里抓出来，再一同前行。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314011.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2b/HeadIconSmall-314011.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314011.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314011.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2b/HeadIconSmall-314011.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314011.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2b/HeadIconSmall-314011.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314011.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>已经很久没有吃过家乡的饭菜了，如果还能与那位奥尔加见上一面的话……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314011.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2b/HeadIconSmall-314011.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314011.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314011.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2b/HeadIconSmall-314011.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314011.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2b/HeadIconSmall-314011.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314011.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>我想，这将会是一个不错的夜晚。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"649302.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-649302.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-649302.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"649302.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-649302.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-649302.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-649302.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-649302.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小洪扎：</div><div>——！！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_8_bg_05.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_8_bg_05\"><img alt=\"3_8_bg_05\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/Cg-3_8_bg_05.png/600px-Cg-3_8_bg_05.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/Cg-3_8_bg_05.png/900px-Cg-3_8_bg_05.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/Cg-3_8_bg_05.png/1200px-Cg-3_8_bg_05.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小洪扎：</div><div>大事不妙了，回声谣，我刚才听到了一段“开战宣言”！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小洪扎：</div><div>这些卑鄙的外来者，她们正在大声密谋……什么复现、混你土，还有什么抓出来！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小洪扎：</div><div>甚至还要把所有占领我们地盘的人类集结起来——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>隔着一面破损的墙壁，手偶将刚才从裂隙中获得的见闻“如实汇报”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>哦不，这一天还是来了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>我梦见过它好多好多次，却没想到是这样一个、一个——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小洪扎：</div><div>是啊，万万没想到魔鬼竟然长着四只眼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>少女体内的色光伴随纷乱的心绪不断变幻。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314012.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/HeadIconSmall-314012.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314012.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314012.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/HeadIconSmall-314012.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314012.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/HeadIconSmall-314012.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314012.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>……我不明白，她为什么非要一直待在那个黑咕隆咚的监听室里，这让我有些缺乏安全感。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>你俩相交多年，能否稍微透露一点儿她的信息，比如她的直属上级，或是她的监听范围……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650210.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-650210.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650210.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650210.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-650210.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650210.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/HeadIconSmall-650210.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650210.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>呵，我之所以能与她相交多年，是因为我很清楚什么该问，什么不该问……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>隐约的议论声从不远处传来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小洪扎：</div><div>哎呀，四只眼她们来了，快躲起来！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>偷听的身影迅速散开，空间将所有不合时宜的话语与回声一并吞没。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在冰冷而空旷的静默中，它等待着夜晚的到来。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "TTS-05"}}